.direnv
librust_out.rlib
result

# repo-local dogfood log (events db + WAL sidecars)
saccade.db
saccade.db-wal
saccade.db-shm

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these files, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains .gitignore that
#  can be added to the global JetBrains .gitignore that
#  can be found at "https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore"
#  and can be added to the project-specific .gitignore, or merged into the global
#  gitignore or into this one. A more nuclear option (not recommended) is to ignore
#  the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
